  "releaseNotes": "# [2.0.0-beta.10](https://github.com/Whaally/Domain/compare/v2.0.0-beta.9...v2.0.0-beta.10) (2025-09-29)\n\n\n### Bug Fixes\n\n* using anything other than a guid as identifier in a distributed system is a mistake ([fdabb27](https://github.com/Whaally/Domain/commit/fdabb273726b04ee37ed2b793d8147c7db7b97a1))\n\n\n### Features\n\n* explicitly return intended side-effects from handlers ([79cbbc4](https://github.com/Whaally/Domain/commit/79cbbc4db144b63443972d1d8d872752d642f7b9))\n\n\n### BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* changed ID types from string to guid\n* side-effects are no longer applied to the context but should be returned from the handler instead.",
